[statement]
The names a condition states give nothing a place in the decision order.
`iso`'s condition names `q`, which needs `X`, and the walk reaches `iso`
first; yet `Y`, which `top` states before `X`, is decided first, for `lo`,
which answers `X` too.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:iso v w

P:iso
V:1
i:q zz

P:q
V:1
D:X

P:w
V:1
D:X

P:v
V:1
D:Y

P:hi
V:1
k:100
p:X

P:lo
V:1
p:X Y=1

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install iso 1
install lo 1
install v 1
install w 1
install top 1
